.\" Cudane Python Subsystem — Man Page
.TH CPS 1 "2026-08-02" "cps 0.0.70" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cps \- Cudane Python Subsystem: shared plugins, themes, and TUIs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cps
.B theme
.B list | apply | register | unregister
.RI [ args ]
.br
.B cps
.B plugin
.B list | run | register | unregister
.RI [ args ]
.br
.B cps
.B tui
.B list | apply | register | unregister
.RI [ args ]
.br
.B cps
.B engine
.RI [ \-\-config \fIfile\fR ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cps
is the reference command-line front end for the Cudane Python Subsystem, the
shared engine embedded by every Cudane component (csr, ctx, ous, mcx, lbt). It
manages the theme, plugin, and TUI registries described by t.desc and p.desc
descriptor files, and boots the engine against a configuration file.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS theme
.TP
.B theme list
List registered themes.
.TP
.B theme apply \fINAME\fR
Render the theme and print it to stdout.
.TP
.B theme register \fINAME\fR \fIPATH\fR
Register a theme.
.TP
.B theme unregister \fINAME\fR
Unregister a theme.
.SS plugin
.TP
.B plugin list
List registered plugins and their aliases.
.TP
.B plugin run \fIALIAS\fR [\fIARGS...\fR]
Run the plugin behind an alias with the given arguments.
.TP
.B plugin register \fINAME\fR \fIPATH\fR
Register a plugin.
.TP
.B plugin unregister \fINAME\fR
Unregister a plugin.
.SS tui
.TP
.B tui list
List registered TUIs.
.TP
.B tui apply \fINAME\fR
Run a TUI.
.TP
.B tui register \fINAME\fR \fIPATH\fR
Register a TUI.
.TP
.B tui unregister \fINAME\fR
Unregister a TUI.
.SS engine
.TP
.B engine [\-\-config \fIFILE\fR]
Boot the Python engine with the configuration in
.I FILE
(default: ~/.config/cps/config.toml, /etc/cps/config.toml, ./cps.toml) and
render a sample prompt.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I t.desc
Theme and TUI descriptors ([theme.<id>], [tui.<id>] sections).
.TP
.I p.desc
Plugin descriptors ([plugin.<id>] sections, alias map).
.TP
.I cps.toml
Engine configuration ([python] section; enable with
\fI[python] enabled = true\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lbt (1),
.BR csr (1),
.BR ctx (1),
.BR ous (1),
.BR mcx (1)
